# Warmane Daily Points Collector
# Supports 1–20 accounts. Add/remove blocks as needed.
# The script stops at the first missing WARMANE_COOKIE_N.
#
# HOW TO GET YOUR COOKIE:
#   1. Open Chrome/Firefox and log into https://www.warmane.com/account
#   2. Press F12 → Network tab
#   3. Click any request to www.warmane.com in the list
#   4. In the right panel, find "Request Headers"
#   5. Copy the full value of the "Cookie:" line (everything after "Cookie: ")
#   6. Paste it as WARMANE_COOKIE_N below
#
# Cookies typically last several weeks. When one expires the script will
# log an error telling you to refresh it.

# --- Account 1 ---
WARMANE_NAME_1=AccountName1
WARMANE_COOKIE_1=PHPSESSID=abc123...; other=value...

# --- Account 2 ---
WARMANE_NAME_2=AccountName2
WARMANE_COOKIE_2=PHPSESSID=xyz456...; other=value...

# --- Account 3 ---
# WARMANE_NAME_3=AccountName3
# WARMANE_COOKIE_3=PHPSESSID=...

# ... repeat up to WARMANE_NAME_20 / WARMANE_COOKIE_20
